<mjml>
  <mj-head>

    <!-- Preheader -->
    <mj-preview>19 May Unconference</mj-preview>

    <mj-include path="./common.mjml" type="mjml" />
    <!-- Centralized styling so editors only touch p/ul/li + links -->
    <mj-include path="./inline-styles.css" type="css" css-inline="css" />
    <mj-style inline="inline">
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <!-- Light theme outer -->
  <mj-body background-color="#fafafa" width="600px">

    <!-- Main container -->
    <mj-wrapper background-color="#ffffff" padding="0">

      <!-- Header -->
      <mj-section padding="20px 24px 12px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image
            width="120px"
            src="https://erlef.org/images/EEF_Isotipo.png"
            alt="EEF Logo"
            align="left"
            padding="0"
          />
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" padding="12px 0 0 0">Attendee Guide</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section padding="0 24px">
        <mj-column><mj-divider /></mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- CONTENT: editors mainly edit p/ul/li below -->
      <mj-section padding="0 24px 18px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text>
            <!-- ========================= -->
            <!-- TEMPLATE CONTENT START     -->
            <!-- Copy/paste blocks + edit text/links only -->
            <!-- ========================= -->

            <!-- SECTION -->
            <p class="section-title">Stockholm Unconference, May 19</p>

            <!-- GENERIC CARD -->
            <div class="card">
            <h2>Basic Details</h2>
              <p>Address is:</p>
              <p><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Viderögatan+3b,+164+40+Kista,+Sweden/@59.4035762,17.9604717,486m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x465f9e918ff113cd:0x92b0d10bd7ac5035!8m2!3d59.4035762!4d17.9604717!16s%2Fg%2F11q2n6pc6k?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDUxMy4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D">Viderögatan 3b, 164 40 Kista, Sweden</a>
              </p>
              <p>At our host <a href="https://entryfy.com/">Entryfy</a><p>

              <p>We will start at 10:00. Feel free to come a bit before.
              We have not made arrangements for breakfast or snacks. We will be going out for
              lunch.
              </p>
              <h2>The Order</h2>
              <p>
                We will start with topic collection.
                This will happen in the shared
                <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1sCl8MCFSiqcQs4jFtXPybWesoRQchzDMyYDqoq8fSMg">topic spreadsheet</a>.
                Feel free to open it at any time and put your topic ideas in.
                </p>

                <p>
                  The topic types are:
                  <ul>
                  <li><b>Teach</b> something you know to others </li>
                  <li><b>Learn</b> something you want to know that others may like to teach</li>
                  <li><b>Discuss</b> a topic for open discussion, problem solving</li>
                  <li><b>Debate</b> two sides of an issue that would be interesting to defend, argue for, convince others</li>
                  </ul>
                </p>

                <p>After topics are in, each one will have 2 minutes to explain and answer questions.</p>

                <p>We will then vote by hands on topics. Voting for more than one topic is allowed.</p>

                <p>Based on the votes, we will start with 15 minute sessions through the order.<p>

                <p>We will stop around 1200 and head out for lunch for about 90 minutes.<p>

               </p><p>In case you need, the registration link: <a href="https://luma.com/n71am1d6" target="_blank">on Luma</a>.</p>

                
            <!-- ========================= -->
            <!-- TEMPLATE CONTENT END       -->
            <!-- ========================= -->
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Footer -->
    <mj-include path="./footer.mjml" type="mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
